SynoChan is a rewrite, in Go and for Synology DSM, of GChan
(https://github.com/Issung/GChan, by Issung and contributors), which is itself
a fork of YChan. The original program is licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 3, and SynoChan is distributed under the same license.

The rewrite was made in November 2026. Compared with the original, the Windows
desktop interface was replaced by a web interface inside DSM, the scraping and
download logic was reimplemented, and tracked lists are stored as JSON instead
of SQLite.

